  "context": {
    "text": "What this experiment measures (MacBook 96k KV Window \u00b7 Direct LLM vs. Med Agent Hub across 3 Scenario Types): Evaluates Gemma-4-12B (Q8_0) locally on an Apple M5 Pro MacBook (64 GB Unified Memory, llama-router ctx-size = 98,304 tokens\u2014zero KV left-truncation) across 12 clinical scenarios (4 huge-context patients \u00d7 3 scenario types: Medication & Staging Conflict Reconciliation, Historical Inpatient/Procedure Lookup, and Grounded Clinical Abstention) and 3 architectures at 1k, 8k, and 32k token budgets: (1) Direct LLM (No Med Agent Hub) calling llama-router directly with the chart and question; (2) Med Agent Hub (Raw Condensed) adding the CHART_SUMMARY_CITED clinical grounding/abstention contract without KB or Graph; and (3) Med Agent Hub (+KB & ClinicalEntityGraph) adding Stage 2 deterministic 4-Layer Clinical KB conflict findings, <clinical_entity_graph>, and Tier 0 overflow citation recovery.",
